{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Mul","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.ConditionallyCompleteLattice.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Lattice","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Abel","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Algebra.Module.FiniteDimension","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Instances.Matrix"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.selected_locally_constant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.selected_locally_constant","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L175-L181","doc":"**The selected word is locally constant**: around any point of a cell there\nis a neighbourhood on which the same word is active. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.active_of_mem_cell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.active_of_mem_cell","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L165-L173","doc":"In its cell, word `i` is active. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.isOpen_cell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.isOpen_cell","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L155-L163","doc":"**Cells are open.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.continuous_lagr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.continuous_lagr","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L150-L152","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.cell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.cell","kind":"def","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L145-L147","doc":"The cell where word `i` is the unique active word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.step_shrinks_distance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.step_shrinks_distance","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L107-L134","doc":"**One step shrinks the distance to a better point** (Polyak).  With\n`d = −x i` for an active `i`, `μ' = μ + s • d`, `0 < s` and\n`s · (d ⬝ d) < 2 (g μ★ − g μ)`, we get `‖μ' − μ★‖² < ‖μ − μ★‖²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.incidence_points_strictly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.incidence_points_strictly","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L99-L105","doc":"Strictly, when `μ★` is strictly better than `μ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.incidence_points_to_optimum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.incidence_points_to_optimum","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L91-L97","doc":"**Attraction.**  The incidence vector of every active word points towards\nany better multiplier: `(μ★ − μ) ⬝ (−x i) ≥ g μ★ − g μ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.isSupergradient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.isSupergradient","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L82-L89","doc":"**The incidence vector is a supergradient.**  If `i` is active at `μ`, then\nfor every `ν`, `g ν ≤ g μ + (ν − μ) ⬝ (−x i)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.dual_concave","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.dual_concave","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L65-L80","doc":"**`g` is concave.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.exists_active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.exists_active","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L58-L63","doc":"Some word is always active. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.dual_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.dual_le","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L54-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.Active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.Active","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L50-L52","doc":"Word `i` is active at `μ`: it attains the minimum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.dual","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Optimization.LagrangianCollisionFlow.dual","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Optimization/LagrangianCollisionFlow.lean#L46-L48","doc":"The Lagrangian dual function `g(μ) = min_i (c i − μ ⬝ x i)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}